cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "jprism-bilingual: controlled comparison of English- and Chinese-fitted Jacobian lenses"
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Zhengyuan
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Paradeluxe/jprism-bilingual"
keywords:
  - jacobian-lens
  - mechanistic-interpretability
  - multilingual
  - logit-lens
  - bilingualism
abstract: >-
  Fitting, measurement, audit, and analysis code for a controlled comparison of
  Jacobian lenses fitted on English WikiText versus Chinese Wikipedia corpora,
  applied to the same models and the same probes. Depends on
  anthropics/jacobian-lens (Apache-2.0).
